{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17836","headline":"夏至日衡阳郡斋书怀 · 令狐楚","name":"夏至日衡阳郡斋书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一来江城守，七见江月圆。\n齿发将六十，乡关越三千。\n褰帷罕游观，闭合多沉眠。\n新节还复至，故交尽相捐。\n何时羾阊阖，上诉高高天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}